{
  "id": "HOS.13",
  "number": "13",
  "bookId": "HOS",
  "reference": "Hosea 13",
  "verseCount": 16,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HOS 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the past, when the tribe of Ephraim spoke, the other tribes of Israel were afraid; they looked up to Ephraim. But the people sinned by worshipping Baal, and for this they will die. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They still keep on sinning by making metal images to worship — idols of silver, designed by human minds, made by human hands. And then they say, “Offer sacrifices to them!” How can anyone kiss those idols — idols in the shape of bulls!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13.2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Probable text",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "And then they",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "bulls!",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew unclear.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And so these people will disappear like morning mist, like the dew that vanishes early in the day. They will be like chaff which the wind blows from the threshing place, like smoke from a chimney.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says, “I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God, who led you out of Egypt. You have no God but me. I alone am your saviour. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.8.11+DEU.8.12+DEU.8.13+DEU.8.14+DEU.8.15+DEU.8.16+DEU.8.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deut 8.11–17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I took care of you in a dry, desert land. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But when you entered the good land, you became full and satisfied, and then you grew proud and forgot me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So I will attack you like a lion. Like a leopard I will lie in wait along your path. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will attack you like a bear that has lost her cubs, and I will tear you open. Like a lion I will devour you on the spot, and will tear you to pieces like a wild animal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I will destroy you, people of Israel! Then who can help you?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13.9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "One ancient translation",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "who can help you?",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "in me is your help.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.8.5+1SA.8.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 8.5–6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You asked for a king and for leaders, but how can they save the nation?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13.10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Verse 10 in Hebrew is unclear.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.10.17+1SA.10.18+1SA.10.19+1SA.10.20+1SA.10.21+1SA.10.22+1SA.10.23+1SA.10.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 10.17–24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.15.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "15.26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In my anger I have given you kings, and in my fury I have taken them away.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Israel's sin and guilt are on record, and the records are safely stored away. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Israel has a chance to live, but is too foolish to take it — like a child about to be born, who refuses to come out of the womb. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.15.55"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Cor 15.55",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will not save this people from the world of the dead or rescue them from the power of death. Bring on",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13.14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Some ancient translations",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Bring on",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "I will be.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " your plagues, death! Bring on your destruction, world of the dead! I will no longer have pity for this people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Even though Israel flourishes like weeds,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13.15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Probable text",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "like weeds",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "among brothers.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " I will send a hot east wind from the desert, and it will dry up their springs and wells. It will take away everything of value. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samaria must be punished for rebelling against me. Her people will die in war; babies will be dashed to the ground, and pregnant women will be ripped open.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
